  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:25c76ca6b4d141f4478f7051d26d77170b241f5cf1360d8e5ab65be63474e7af",
      "request_id": "25c76ca6b4d141f4478f7051d26d77170b241f5cf1360d8e5ab65be63474e7af",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8468945daed9b5f6b36cbdae76ecba57",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "华盛顿，连续逆转穆塞蒂和塔比洛，闯进生涯首个五百赛决赛。对弗里茨，首盘抢七落败，最终收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9c807c853aa8f607ea2c7b9dbc9e52e408676378683762ff36411fae1ec12031",
      "words_sha256": "db1cdf76f134028890bac5a9c9664487eaa9fb0bdf0716409fbfd03d1866cd02"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:28f225ac023811e2d9bd4297c7ed3487346d5e4e225a8a25b3ca47e2d851a78a",
      "request_id": "28f225ac023811e2d9bd4297c7ed3487346d5e4e225a8a25b3ca47e2d851a78a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bd5f28d6baf7147e7d11bc45832f843f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先从澳网说起。资格赛连过三关，再赢下一场五盘大战，拿到大满贯正赛首胜。第二轮，他三盘输给门西克。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0481a884165392be8857ec8947e75824ddef07de64fca0010414052b0f3708c3",
      "words_sha256": "0ccf111dfae6fd8e2985384139b0c6da8248fc523244c7f4b01a5248b6ba9056"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2bf263a4bda11b96ae974a44ce8f7eab3bdbb745dee08920b5e982a1f509e7fb",
      "request_id": "2bf263a4bda11b96ae974a44ce8f7eab3bdbb745dee08920b5e982a1f509e7fb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9a095f35a674caf554a2dc2c4f15d01e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接着，在蒙特利尔首次打进大师赛4强。但来到美网，他第一轮就三盘输给布云朝克特。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e7c7bce75752a7497111aecdf3af2c83609d9f657ab98b1f0d153702e8115f90",
      "words_sha256": "d2cd7e73215b2eb5b7ef963a2ef1f941c38d2ba91032b395dd8267e3411b9a80"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:351be80390b0a49c9bf87b55795d7053a92cfa4abc218aa2c3149244225516de",
      "request_id": "351be80390b0a49c9bf87b55795d7053a92cfa4abc218aa2c3149244225516de",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "92f3e4038bf5d33836ddd3902c526be9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴黎第二轮，两盘输给鲁德。出局时，他的赛季积分来到三千二百三十四分，年终资格还要等待。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ffc403ec570f6cd5492f9ae5daf21189149ca96d35bd4a8b40382f57a178eb10",
      "words_sha256": "8a19fcca2594f8290e0be63410c20b2d232567c43f67d0c0bf65a5406f841d6b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:51a706ad98115f293394f0392b8c66789f747ac5989368e9b0e9df2a6be032d7",
      "request_id": "51a706ad98115f293394f0392b8c66789f747ac5989368e9b0e9df2a6be032d7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6681501750eec43d58fa0df0cf164485",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "法网第四轮，先丢两盘，他连扳三盘逆转卡雷尼奥·布斯塔。首次闯进大满贯8强，随后三盘输给兹维列夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "563cfebb8ef8ff4051134f9b73dd9cb8be212c237a2da123f1cfb321e0312d74",
      "words_sha256": "f8935fb9bb5b4ce2630dec9073a26301ec55cea093856b23ce09002596ab4ff3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:525d276a61ded96286bcd1a571b3b48a39633ef0534adad340d379f4c6c36498",
      "request_id": "525d276a61ded96286bcd1a571b3b48a39633ef0534adad340d379f4c6c36498",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "679b591d2d2a68d424933af7648f82a5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "随后，巴塞罗那打进4强，马德里和罗马连续打进8强。红土上的突破还没有结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a82aa7c065b2b8cd93b84a6600677e91536fc02ee2d0fdbb457263c5453b30c9",
      "words_sha256": "3d4812e2f2576ebb2319f3c7548b5103164f61f286c27e98faca1164b86b40fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5e253c136912bddf32a9cd29905e8af279102384726ecb7549827a442c8752c8",
      "request_id": "5e253c136912bddf32a9cd29905e8af279102384726ecb7549827a442c8752c8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "351ae5451af0c97784359316165887cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网第二轮，再赢一场五盘大战。第三轮对望月慎太郎，先赢一盘，随后连丢三盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3697c2725f0e96666601ac679303f948938faf1a9ef38466eb78c833cfe34bca",
      "words_sha256": "c8a6411d698467659d570600e9feca9c9d02847904af4e452c3ca94142ac0014"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:61aa9e30d705b0d15c29e4d93f9919e11290f57f53bc72422cc2ab6a2a4e139a",
      "request_id": "61aa9e30d705b0d15c29e4d93f9919e11290f57f53bc72422cc2ab6a2a4e139a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cb8441deda507457d3b68f4135d6144b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十一月六日，阿尔卡拉斯在巴黎击败弗里茨，霍达尔锁定最后一席。一年前还是大学生的他，今年第一次入围年终。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "29b3cd4d0ed4f70d608836978e87836a0988e80b416118086884c844d466e752",
      "words_sha256": "b293a8ce3f01a989494847d670e42110bce1a5ed7e78cd522d6a679881cdf3cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a1f378dc260615a08cd1a36528aa08f8ae03c4dc877a1879001063cd2daa7db9",
      "request_id": "a1f378dc260615a08cd1a36528aa08f8ae03c4dc877a1879001063cd2daa7db9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a57122c1c9b6d1e0576e6a9f97042251",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一次在都灵，你最想看霍达尔碰上谁？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "73204a12cfc96f012b6fcff5d0ee07cb3e281bd91c437429e6ef0adbb641e2ad",
      "words_sha256": "489d27e2af26a0fc4eb1b82c02dc8617fccf57268521634e6d85adcde2901367"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:aa71b10ff84a23f6da13fe08add7efdac82e31fe508b78174dae6b3c0670f62e",
      "request_id": "aa71b10ff84a23f6da13fe08add7efdac82e31fe508b78174dae6b3c0670f62e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ce9169eb89b656d89b2e22769768d3ab",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四月的马拉喀什，两盘击败特伦杰利蒂，拿下生涯首座巡回赛冠军。这是他第一次参加巡回赛级别的红土赛事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3b785d2027af12870e33269e0ecb752751b6b1058b02517789fb338956959b53",
      "words_sha256": "aa1d8a91882b53aa195d301051e45184c7f583442e6b6ab699a2e1c67c0a7de2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:abda36e1d498b2a8a9a2e389b156c722a69332e9280da191244b3d1a3364dbe0",
      "request_id": "abda36e1d498b2a8a9a2e389b156c722a69332e9280da191244b3d1a3364dbe0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "485eb01790e33bf6158b6b464df2c678",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从大学球场到都灵，霍达尔首进年终。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "99129c9b911f84ad37b941c341a86b0fd1b48dfc162107c839c423614357a9a1",
      "words_sha256": "d240cf18397dbe097c9d0436610f87236c3cbaa4a3310f061d3b5b23ee72fc1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b02da06897f2f4ba8e8e530828f72768e3f80c25eb1fa773418fbb043f7296d0",
      "request_id": "b02da06897f2f4ba8e8e530828f72768e3f80c25eb1fa773418fbb043f7296d0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "64690933ffb3b40f0bcc281a3f1b0273",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "截至十一月七日，三千二百三十四分，赛季积分榜第九。辛纳已退赛，霍达尔位列本届总决赛八位正选之中。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b28591b4162552736dacff84df322c5616020aeebc34544ee34714c539f3df4c",
      "words_sha256": "e48101538050ed5f2d0ed6e6dbb2e510135877e917eb5b97704090449984c950"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "55c3bcce5b8c41534d0dc89bc3d2a50e9a8c4896fbea489b4141db07f1b9b246",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bc63c2423148b4bd2f2664196ba39bae61c30ce44a443a56e7ad3cd149d3152d",
      "request_id": "bc63c2423148b4bd2f2664196ba39bae61c30ce44a443a56e7ad3cd149d3152d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5c0d02b90e678de38408c5c5a495c5b6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "对福基纳，他先赢一盘，第二盘又领先一个破发。最终被逆转，距离大师赛首冠还差一步。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6b0ed817d7721c5c274b5c0e5280be7111ad1158f702abc1ffb4915f372c18b8",
      "words_sha256": "b2d7123ef0bee386b71d6e09982463302967b68424cf81b1f534d1f897b46375"
    },
    {
