        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海，前四场全部逆转过关。半决赛两盘击败梅德韦德夫，第一次走进大师赛决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c13a4fe4e9d9e7957ab3d07e25e6265a5befac351adc22970861781211ed5fca",
      "words_sha256": "a4eba733f02ffcf9f797c80cacca1f53c838079bfbf6b0f2c50a14f6ffa073d7"
    },
